`. A `name`, `website` or `linkedinUrl` sent beside it is not used.","anyOf":[{"type":"integer","exclusiveMinimum":0,"maximum":9007199254740991},{"type":"string","pattern":"^[1-9]\\d*$"}]},"accountId":{"description":"An account in your workspace, on its own. Its existing match is used when it has one; otherwise the account is resolved from its website, LinkedIn handle and name exactly as the app would, so an account we have not yet matched still works when the company is in our data.","type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","format":"uuid"},"website":{"description":"The company's own website, as a URL or a domain (`https://zapier.com`, `zapier.com`). The strongest key after the LinkedIn page: it is matched against our data, then, on a miss, followed through a cross-domain redirect, so a legacy or vanity domain that forwards to the current site still resolves. Sent on its own as the bare site (no path or subdomain), a data or social platform's domain names the platform itself (`zoominfo.com` is ZoomInfo); a page on such a site (`linkedin.com/company/acme`) is not a company website. When our data files the company under a different website, a website sent on its own is also tried as the LinkedIn page it spells (`gong.io` as `gong-io`), accepted only for an established company whose name matches the domain. An alias that does not forward to the company's current site is a miss: send the current website, the LinkedIn page or the name. Does not have to be in your workspace.","type":"string","minLength":3,"maxLength":2048},"linkedinUrl":{"description":"The company's LinkedIn page — the `linkedinUrl` a find result or a person row carries, copied through (`https://www.linkedin.com/company/zapier`); the bare handle (`zapier`) is accepted too. Tried first when present, and the most precise key there is. Showcase pages are not company pages: send the company's own. Copy the handle from a Trayo result or the company's own site rather than guessing it from the name — a slug that belongs to a different company resolves to that company.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2048},"name":{"description":"The company name. Tried last and the weakest key, since a common name can match the wrong company — send the website when you have it. A name-only lookup finds only companies Trayo holds under that name; an employer that a Trayo person row names with `companyId: null` has no company record, and its name will usually miss.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200}},"additionalProperties":false}},"required":["company"],"additionalProperties":false},"CompanyResearchResponseDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"company":{"type":"object","properties":{"companyId":{"type":"string","description":"Trayo's id for the company. Send it back as `companyId` to name this exact company again."},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The company as Trayo records it."},"website":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The company's website domain as Trayo files it."},"linkedinUrl":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The company's LinkedIn page, when Trayo has it."},"accountId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The workspace account for this company: the one you sent, or the account that already holds its website or LinkedIn page. Null when the company is not in your workspace."},"resolvedBy":{"type":"string","enum":["account_match","company_id","linkedin","website","redirect","name"],"description":"Which key identified the company — the same resolver the Trayo app uses, in its order. `account_match`: the account's existing match. `linkedin`: the LinkedIn page, as sent or as spelled by a website sent on its own. `website`: the website domain. `redirect`: the website, after following a cross-domain redirect to the company's current site. `name`: the name, the weakest key.\n\nA match is exact on the key you sent, which is only the company you meant if the key was. A slug or name can belong to a different company than the one you mean, and the answer will then describe that company. Read `name` and `website` back before acting, and prefer `website` as the key — a domain resolves to whoever owns it."},"nameMatch":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","enum":["exact","approximate"]},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Set only when `resolvedBy` is `name`, null otherwise. `exact`: the company's name equals the name looked up once legal suffixes (Inc, GmbH, Ltd) are dropped. `approximate`: the closest name Trayo holds, which can be a different company (\"CR Management Consulting\" answered with \"m3 management consulting\"). Check an `approximate` match against what you know of the company before using it, and leave it out when it does not fit."}},"required":["companyId","name","website","linkedinUrl","accountId","resolvedBy","nameMatch"],"additionalProperties":false},"research":{"type":"object","properties":{"displayName":{"type":"string"},"oneLiner":{"type":"string","description":"One sentence on what the company does."},"industry":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"hqLocation":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"employeeCount":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"A count or a band, as Trayo states it."},"foundingYear":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"whyNow":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"A short categorisation of the point (\"Acquisition\", \"Analyst Recognition\", \"Enterprise Scale\") — what you can group or scan by. Not a restatement of `text`."},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The point itself."}},"required":["label","text"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Timely hooks drawn from the company's recent LinkedIn updates — launches, funding, M&A, leadership changes, hiring. Empty when Trayo holds no substantive recent update, which is an honest answer, not an error."},"fit":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"A short categorisation of the point (\"Acquisition\", \"Analyst Recognition\", \"Enterprise Scale\") — what you can group or scan by. Not a restatement of `text`."},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The point itself."}},"required":["label","text"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Why this company is a target for what your workspace sells, inferred from its industry, size and tech stack against your `solutions`."}},"required":["displayName","oneLiner","industry","hqLocation","employeeCount","foundingYear","whyNow","fit"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The overview as structured fields. `reportMarkdown` is the same content rendered for display. Neither field carries source links."},"reportMarkdown":{"type":"string","description":"The same overview rendered as Markdown, ready to show — headings and bullet points. `research` is the structured form of it. Carries no source links; see the note on `research`."},"generatedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"When this overview was generated — always this call; nothing is stored."}},"required":["company","research","reportMarkdown","generatedAt"],"additionalProperties":false},"PersonResearchBodyDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"person":{"type":"object","properties":{"personId":{"description":"A person in your workspace, on its own. Their existing match is read when they have one; otherwise their LinkedIn username is looked up, so a person you have only just imported still works when the profile is in our data.","type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","format":"uuid"},"linkedinUrl":{"description":"The person's LinkedIn profile — the `linkedinUrl` a find result or a stakeholder-search result carries, copied through (`https://www.linkedin.com/in/jane-doe`); the bare handle (`jane-doe`) is accepted too. Does not have to be in your workspace.","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2048}},"additionalProperties":false},"grounded":{"description":"Off by default: no web search, and the overview is built from the profile Trayo holds alone — fast and reliable. `true` adds web search to recover timely company intel and personal facts: slower (5–15 s rather than 2–3 s), and Trayo occasionally fails to answer in this mode (`503 research_failed`, retry once). Both modes draw on the workspace's usage quota the same way. What it finds must be sourced to be said, but the sources are not published — treat the result as a lead to check rather than as evidence.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["person"],"additionalProperties":false},"PersonResearchResponseDto":{"type":"object","properties":{"person":{"type":"object","properties":{"fullName":{"type":"string","description":"The person as Trayo records them."},"linkedinUrl":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Their LinkedIn profile, when Trayo has it."},"photoUrl":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The person's profile photo, as a directly loadable image URL. Null when Trayo holds no real photo for them — show initials then. Every route that returns a person carries this field under this name."},"location":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"city":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"City, e.g. `San Diego`. Null when the profile names only a region or metro area."},"state":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"State, province or region, e.g. `California`."},"country":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code, e.g. `US`."},"raw":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The location as written on the profile, e.g. `Greater San Diego Area`. Usually present; the only populated field when the profile names just a metro area."}},"required":["city","state","country","raw"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Where the person says they are on their LinkedIn profile. Usually their home metro area, but it is the person's own statement, not a verified address, and it is not where their company is headquartered. Null when Trayo has no location for them. From the profile Trayo holds, in every mode. Not the same field as `research.location`, which is a web fact stated only when `grounded` is on and Trayo could cite it."},"companyDomain":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The website domain of the employer named in research.company, for displaying its logo. Null when Trayo has no matching employer domain."},"company":{"anyOf":[{"type":"object","properties":{"companyId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Trayo's id for this employer. Send it back as `company.companyId` (company research, stakeholder search, job-change search) to name this exact company. Null when Trayo holds no company record for the employer: `name` is then the free text from the profile, and looking it up by name will usually miss. Search for it with a find companies `query` instead."},"name":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The employer as the profile names it."},"website":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The employer's website, when Trayo holds a record for it."},"linkedinUrl":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The employer's LinkedIn page, when Trayo holds a record for it."}},"required":["companyId","name","website","linkedinUrl"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The employer of the person's current role on the profile Trayo holds. Usually the company `research.company` names, which is free text. Null when the profile shows no current role."},"personId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"The person this call was scoped to, when you sent one."},"accountId":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"That person's account in your workspace, when they have one."},"resolvedBy":{"type":"string","enum":["stored_match","linkedin"],"description":"`stored_match`: the workspace person's existing match. `linkedin`: the LinkedIn profile, looked up by its handle."}},"required":["fullName","linkedinUrl","photoUrl","location","companyDomain","company","personId","accountId","resolvedBy"],"additionalProperties":false},"grounded":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether web-search grounding was used for this overview."},"research":{"type":"object","properties":{"fullName":{"type":"string"},"title":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"company":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"careerProgression":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"},"description":"Notable roles, oldest first, each as `Role at Company (start – end)`."},"professionalInsights":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"A short categorisation of the point (\"Acquisition\", \"Analyst Recognition\", \"Enterprise Scale\") — what you can group or scan by. Not a restatement of `text`."},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The point itself."}},"required":["label","text"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"Their role and trajectory, tied to how what your workspace sells could be relevant."},"challenges":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"label":{"type":"string","description":"A short categorisation of the point (\"Acquisition\", \"Analyst Recognition\", \"Enterprise Scale\") — what you can group or scan by. Not a restatement of `text`."},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The point itself."}},"required":["label","text"],"additionalProperties":false},"description":"What they are likely up against. Inferred from role, seniority and industry when `grounded` is off; evidenced and cited when it is on."},"personalInsights":{"type":"array","i